  "composition_summary": "Preserved the single user message unchanged; no justified prompt repair. The task is a component draft, not a submission or activation. Drafted one class-22 pure-logic candidate pc-check-timeout-ms with only name/description/content, per the target typed-inputs interface. The body uses inputs.get(\"timeout_ms\") (not direct access) so a missing key is a valid validation outcome, returns {valid, timeout_ms} with no exceptions or coercion, and assigns result on every path. It makes zero host calls and contains no imports or I/O. This is an unapproved draft; Q1, observed behavior and human Q2 precede activation, and the target inputs interface is not guaranteed deployed runtime support. No compatibility/intent/settings arrays were populated.",
